cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PA-Loss with a stop-gradient control"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the thesis below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Xiyuan
    family-names: Guo
    affiliation: "McMaster University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CharlesGuooo/pa-loss-stopgrad"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A planning-aware loss that routes a differentiable planning-risk gradient into
  the mode distribution of a multimodal trajectory predictor, paired with a
  stop-gradient control that isolates where the gradient lands. Both training
  arms compute the identical objective and differ in one operation, so a
  separation between them attributes the effect to the predictor rather than to
  the planner consuming its forecasts.
keywords:
  - trajectory prediction
  - autonomous driving
  - motion planning
  - multimodal prediction
  - stop-gradient
preferred-citation:
  type: thesis
  title: "Planning-Aware Trajectory Prediction: Routing Downstream Planning Risk into a Frozen-Perception Multimodal Predictor"
  authors:
